.TH tine-capture 1  "capture " 
.SH NAME
tine\-capture \- Open Quick Capture in the desktop app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine capture\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open Quick Capture in the desktop app
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
